// Script Variable SaysList :
"P790795795" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Superb work, {TaskForceName}. I've got the data on that facility, it is right nearby. <t=7 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>I am sending the information to you right now, you'll have to overload the computers there to destroy their machines.<t=7 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Be aware of their alarm system, if you do not disarm those computers in time, you will have to deal with more War Works!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P8061661" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Tin Mage Mark II reporting. It appears that the Praetorians have strong control on this area of Nerva. <t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>I'm looking into the intelligence about the storage facility here for the War Works.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Ignore Malta and take care of the War Walkers; those Malta agents are the least of our worries. "
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1280579658" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>This is Lord Recluse, contacting the Vanguard operatives calling themselves {TaskForceName}. <t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>Vanguard wishes to earn my trust to help fight off the Praetorians, hrm? <t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>Vanguard is lucky that I wish only the utter destruction of this Tyrant and his regime. I will send Arbiter Daos to the Vanguard compound to begin negotiations."
