"P3630704521" "You've hacked the computer!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P835470529" "INTRUDERS DETECTED."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1635873246" "SECURING WAREHOUSE."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3486707727" "ELIMINATE ALL HOSTILES WITHIN THE FACILITY."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2327262927" "Director 11"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P562430302" "The Directors are a mysterious group of individuals who are in charge of the Malta organization. No one knows their true names, not even the directors themselves. Many conspiracy theorists believe that the Directors are all the heads of very important organizations.<br><br>Director 11 is whispered in circles to be one of the most skilled members within Malta. No one has lived to find out who Director 11 truly is."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1137531143" "<shout>Move! This is our moment to strike, we can still recover the information on those Walkers!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1652860897" "I'm fully prepared to handle a squad of Incarnate level meta's. You all won't get out of here alive."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2801638064" "Praetoria is a prime example of what Malta is fighting against, don't you see?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2559860162" "You meta's have too much power, it will eventually destroy you and enslave us all!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1617223435" "We in Malta fight to keep Earth free, to prevent the same fate that Praetoria met."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2462542613" "If you meta's hadn't tried to explore other dimensions, we wouldn't be in this situation in the first place...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2436071124" "You'll... never win the war...<em>even if Tyrant is defeated...<em>one of you will... rise to... replace him..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - MaltaBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P48636595" "Defeat Director 11"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1434366112" "<shout>We've got a major MHI in progress!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3935457698" "<shout>Director 11 needs back up, move!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4127035213" "You've secured Crimson Crove and arrested Director 11, one of the mysterious Directors of the Malta organization!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2232983369" "Excellent work, {TaskForceName}, I expected no less from you all. We have Director 11 in custody now and are busy trying to see if we can find any other higher ups within Malta. We hope that he will work together with us, but the odds of that are very small.<br><br>Arbiter Daos arrived at the Vanguard compound a few moments ago to begin negotiations. Which means we are going to once more need your aid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Apex 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P733149483" "I <i>knew</i> something was going to go wrong! Good thing you guys were here to clean it up! We've got a situation though, a <i>bad</i> one. Praetorians have launched an attack from within Portal Corp <i>and</i> the Grandville tower. Lady Grey is taking Dark Watcher, Borea, Gaussian, Serpent Drummer, and Levantera to deal with Grandville tower.<br><br><color orange>You need to get to Portal Corp and secure the situation over there!"
// Answer Text :
"P636293253" "We'll handle it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Tina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3337361544" "Thank goodness you all arrived when you did, the Praetorians just started pouring out from the portal!<br><br>With the area cleared out, we can secure the portal again, but there's still a large number of them up in the courtyard!"
// Answer Text :
"P3461401376" "We're on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ApexReturn 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page PortalNormal Text :
"P899204871" "Good to see you're all back in one piece. Lady Grey and the others just returned from Grandville with the information we need. Now that we've got things secured here in Primal Earth, it's time to strike back against the Praetorians and show Emperor Cole just what happens when you try to take over <i>our</i> world!"
// Answer Text :
"P1984122306" "Ask about available missions"
// Page GrandvilleAmbushed Text :
"P4043366699" "That's some great information you all got from Arachnos. What's that? Recluse tried to kill you within his own tower? Huh, figures. Even in the face of another invasion, Recluse is still petty enough to attack people who are <i>helping</i> him.<br><br>Whatever, we got what we needed from Arachnos, so it's time for us to make our next move: setting up the offensive against Praetoria!"
// Page GrandvilleNormal Text :
"P3514796980" "I'm relieved you all got back from Grandville safely. You can never be too careful when dealing with Arachnos. One moment they're your friends, the next they betray you. I'd like to think, though, that Recluse is smart enough to not cross Vanguard.<br><br>The information you found is definitely very... weird, to say the least. We'll look into it further, but for now we need your help in preparing for the counter attack against the Praetorians."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P383444948" "We currently have Arbiter Daos and Captain Dietrich working on a temporary truce between Longbow and Arachnos. I have run the calculations and believe that the odds of any sort of truce being found within the next few hours is slim to none, given the personality of Dietrich and the methods of Daos.<br><br>I also believe that the Praetorians will take this moment to strike against us to try to break that truce and eliminate two high ranking officials within the two groups. This is assuming that the Praetorians know what is happening, which I believe is a safe assumption to make."
// AcceptString :
"P671793102" "Which is where my team comes in."
// SendOffString :
"P3155328757" "Precisely. It isn't the most glorious duty, but your group is the only one that can fight off the incoming Praetorians, should they attack the compound. <br><br><color orange>You should head to the conference room as soon as possible for guard duty. Just be ready for anything to happen.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2582129672" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Unique Allies</color>"

