// EntryString :
"P725496664" "You can hear Captain Dietrich listing her complaints about forming an alliance with Arachnos."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P266025671" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>MAIN COMPOUND HAS BEEN BREACHED! <t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>ENEMY WAR WORKS HAVE TAKEN THE MAIN COMPOUND! <t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>ALL CIVILIANS PLEASE SEEK SHELTER!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1985350812" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>This is  Tin Mage. Excellent work in securing Portal Corp. <t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Time is of the essence. We are going to establish the coordinates for the Rift Enclosure in Praetoria, along with a stable line of defense.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Return to the Vanguard compound and prepare yourselves. We are going to send you all through to strike at the Praetorians before they can send in their main invasion fleet."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2381109307" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>Tin Mage, reporting. You need to work fast, {TaskForceName}. <t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>We have it on good authority that the Praetorians are preparing to power up Neuron's tower to send in their full fleet straight into the heart of Atlas Park and Grandville..<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SaddleBrown>We need Portal Corp re-secured so that we can get into Praetoria and stop the main invasion."

