// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4273719940" "Bane Spider Executioner"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2241782693" "Arbiter Daos"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1574243939" "<em><em><em><em><em>I assure you that we will cooperate. We do, after all, have information that you all could use. Isn't that right?<em><em><em><em><em><em>Hrm. This is a troubling turn of events..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2324441308" "Captain Dietrich"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3411230390" "<em><em><em>Vanguard is out of their minds! Side with Recluse, with Arachnos?! We can't trust them, we don't NEED them!<em><em><em><em><em><em>This is Vanguard's fault for dealing with Arachnos!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1658845313" "Longbow Ballista"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P510700898" "Lady Grey"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P895661730" "Now, I know that this is somewhat... unusual, but we must band together if we're to fight the Praetorians.<em><em><em><em><em>Daos is correct. Dietrich, I don't like it either, but this is war. We need to do this to win.<em><em>What?!<em><em>{TaskForceName}, I need you to retake the compound while we hold up here!"

