// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2713639609" "I knew something was going to go wrong! Good thing you guys were here to clean it up! We've got a situation on our hands, though.<em> Praetorians have launched an attack from within Portal Corp and the Grandville tower. <em>Lady Grey is taking Dark Watcher, Borea, Gaussian, Serpent Drummer, and Levantera to deal with Portal Corp.<em>You need to get to Grandville and fast! When you're there, the important thing is to secure all the information that Arachnos has on the Praetorians."

