"P267233015" "Neuron"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3088778962" "Come on, come on... I programmed this to go faster! Why isn't it working?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2835619979" "Great, more problems. Can't you see I'm trying to launch an invasion here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3701903698" "Why can't you all just lay down and let us take over your world?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3059961856" "This would be so much easier if you all could understand the word 'surrender"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4197460493" "You do realize that this won't stop anything, right? I'm a speedster, I recover quickly, it's what I do."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P446441033" "I won't hear the end of this for a while, but you've only prolonged the inevitable. You'll see soon enough."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2750021701" "<em><shout>Ugh, fine! I'll send out some clones, this is taking way too long to handle."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2864868122" "<em><shout>Sigh... do I have to do everything around here? These clones are expensive, you know."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1417077524" "<em><shout>That was the ideal proposal if we were attacked. Fine, fine, I'll just increase things up a bit."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1676394042" "Well, that's not good. You're all making me waste a lot of good resources on this!"

